##########Final Log:{"Question": {"task": "Paul got a box of 440 crayons for his birthday. During the school year he gave 111 crayons to his friends while he lost 106 crayons. How many crayons did he have left?", "step": "", "answer": "223"}, "Answer": "223", "Step": "", "All_answers": [{"Math Solver5rdM": ["None."], "Mathematical Analyst94P5": ["## Problem solving process analysis\n\nPaul started with {initial_crayons} crayons.\nHe gave away {given_away} crayons to his friends.\nHe also lost {lost} crayons.\nSo the number of crayons remaining {remaining} is {initial_crayons} minus {given_away} minus {lost}.\nThe answer is {remaining} = {initial_crayons} - {given_away} - {lost}.\n\n## Actual analysis and solution process\n\nIn this question, {initial_crayons} = 440, {given_away} = 111, and {lost} = 106.\n\nPaul started with 440 crayons.\nHe gave away 111 crayons: 440 - 111 = 329 crayons remaining.\nHe lost 106 more crayons: 329 - 106 = 223 crayons remaining.\n\nThe answer is 223"], "Programming Expert8MMf": ["```python\ndef crayons_left():\n    initial_crayons = 440\n    crayons_given_away = 111\n    crayons_lost = 106\n    remaining_crayons = initial_crayons - crayons_given_away - crayons_lost\n    return remaining_crayons\n\nanswer = crayons_left()\n```\nthe answer is 223"], "Inspector4zRb": ["## My Solving Process\n\n**Step 1: Identify the given information**\n- Initial crayons: 440\n- Crayons given away: 111\n- Crayons lost: 106\n\n**Step 2: Calculate step by step**\n- After giving away crayons: 440 - 111 = 329 crayons remaining\n- After losing crayons: 329 - 106 = 223 crayons remaining\n\n**Verification:**\n- Both reference agents calculated: 440 - 111 - 106 = 223\n- Their answers are consistent and mathematically correct\n\nThe answer is 223"], "Math Solver8Pts": ["Paul started with 440 crayons.  \nHe gave away 111 crayons: 440\u202f\u2212\u202f111\u202f=\u202f329 crayons left.  \nHe then lost 106 crayons: 329\u202f\u2212\u202f106\u202f=\u202f223 crayons remai